-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §132: existing counsellors' pay is converted
-- as existing teachers' is; the counselling allowance is left out of the
-- salary to convert (X of §44); after placement, §131's allowance applies.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `132`

DECLARE `pay item before the reform` IS ONE OF `the counselling allowance`, `another item §44(ב) lists`

-- (א)–(ב): the conversion is the teachers' (§44, encoded in its own
-- section); of the items before the reform, the counselling allowance is
-- not in X.
@ref akn:art_132__para_a akn:art_132__para_b
GIVEN i IS A `pay item before the reform`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in a counsellor's salary to convert` i IF
    NOT i EQUALS `the counselling allowance`

-- (ג): after placement in the table, the counselling allowance of §131.
@ref akn:art_132__para_c
GIVEN `placed in the table` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 131's allowance applies` `placed in the table` IF
    `placed in the table`

#ASSERT NOT `in a counsellor's salary to convert` `the counselling allowance`
